name: simSetModuleInfo
description: 
luaSynopsis: sim.setModuleInfo(string moduleName,int infoType,string/int info)
pythonSynopsis: sim.setModuleInfo(string moduleName,int infoType,string/int info)
inputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
1. reserved: set to nullptr with plugins that have the simInit entry points
2. infoType: the type of information to set
3. stringInfo: a string information value, in case the information type is for a string.
4. intInfo: an integer information value, in case the information type is for an integer.
outputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
